#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:21
msgid "Backup Frequency"
msgstr "Tiet twischen twee Sekern:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel5_2)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:41
msgid "Do &backup:"
msgstr "&Sekerheitskopie maken:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, fBackupFrequency)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:69
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Select in this list how frequently backups are done. Possible values are:</p>"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>\"On Every HotSync\" - A backup of your handheld will be done every time you HotSync</li>"
"\n"
"<li>\"On Request Only\" - A backup of your handheld will be done only when you choose your next sync to be of type \"Backup\"</li>"
"\n"
"</ul>"
"\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Op disse List kannst Du utsöken, wo faken Sekerheitkopien opstellt warrt. Möögliche Weerten sünd:</p>"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>\"Bi elkeen HotSync\" -Bi elkeen HotSync warrt en Sekerheitkopie vun Dien Handreekner maakt.</li>"
"\n"
"<li>\"Bloots op Anfraag\" - En Sekerheitkopie vun Dien Handreekner warrt bloots opstellt, wenn Du dat bi't verleden Maal so fastleggt hest.</li>"
"\n"
"</ul>"
"\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, fBackupFrequency)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:73
msgid "On Every HotSync"
msgstr "Bi elkeen HotSync"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, fBackupFrequency)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:78
msgid "On Request Only"
msgstr "Bloots op Anfraag"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:91
msgid "Databases"
msgstr "Datenbanken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, TextLabel5)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, fBackupOnly)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:105 kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:124
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Enter the databases types you wish to exclude from the backup operation here. Use this setting if backing up some databases crashes the handheld, or if you do not want a backup of some databases (like AvantGo pages).</p>"
"<p>Entries with square brackets [] are <i>creator codes</i> like <tt>[lnch]</tt> and can exclude a whole range of databases. Entries without the brackets list database names, and may include shell-style wildcards, like <tt>*_a68k</tt>.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Datenbanktypen angeven, för de Du keen Sekerheitkopien opstellen wullt. Bruuk disse Optschoon, wenn dat Sekern vun en Datenbank Dien Handreekner afstörten lett, oder wenn Du keen Sekerheitkopie vun en Datenbank hebben wullt (so as AvantGo-Sieden).</p>"
"<p>Indrääg in eckig Klemmen [] sünd <i>Opsteller-Kodes</i> as <tt>[lnch]</tt> un köönt hele Koppeln vun Datenbanken utsluten. Indrääg ahn disse Klemmen list Datenbanknaams op un köönt Platzhollers in Konsool-Stil bargen, so as <tt>*_a68k</tt>.</p>"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel5)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:108
msgid "&No backup:"
msgstr "&Keen Sekerheitkopie:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, fBackupOnlyChooser)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:134
msgid "<qt>Click here to open the database selection dialog. This dialog allows you to check the databases you want to exclude from the backup from a list.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Klick hier, wenn Du den Datenbank-Utsöökdialoog opmaken wullt. Binnen dissen Dialoog kannst Du de Datenbanken op en List utsöken, de Du vun't Sekerheitkoperen utsluten wullt.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, fBackupOnlyChooser)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, fSkipDBChooser)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:137 kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:186
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, TextLabel6)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, fSkipDB)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:154 kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:173
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Enter the databases types you wish to exclude from the restore operation here (like AvantGo databases). They will be skipped even if they exist in the set of backup databases on the handheld. If you still want to install an ignored database to the handheld, you can always manually install it to the handheld.</p>"
"<p>Entries with square brackets [] are <i>creator codes</i> like <tt>[lnch]</tt> and can exclude a whole range of databases. Entries without the brackets list database names, and may include shell-style wildcards, like <tt>*_a68k</tt>.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Giff hier de Datenbanktypen an, de Du vun de Wedderherstellen utsluten wullt (as AvantGo-Datenbanken). Se warrt ok denn övergahn, wenn se dat binnen den Sett vun sekerte Datenbanken op den Handreekner gifft. Wenn Du en övergahn Datenbank liekers wedderherstellen wullt, kannst Du dat jümmers per Hand doon.</p>"
"<p>Indrääg in eckig Klemmen [] sünd <i>Opsteller-Kodes</i> as <tt>[lnch]</tt> un köönt hele Koppeln vun Datenbanken utsluten. Indrääg ahn disse Klemmen list Datenbanknaams op un köönt Platzhollers in Konsool-Stil bargen, so as <tt>*_a68k</tt>.</p>"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel6)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:157
msgid "Not &restored:"
msgstr "Nich &wedderherstellt:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, fSkipDBChooser)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:183
msgid "<qt>Click here to open the database selection dialog. This dialog allows you to select the databases you want to exclude from the restore operation from a list.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Klick hier, wenn Du den Datenbank-Utsöökdialoog opmaken wullt. Binnen den Dialoog kannst Du de Datenbanken op en List utsöken, de Du vun't Wedderherstellen utsluten wullt.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, fRunConduitsWithBackup)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:198
msgid "<qt>Check this box to run the selected conduits before every backup. This makes sure the backup is up to date with the last changes from your PC.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Maak dit an, wenn Du de utsöchten Kanaals jümmers vöran dat Sekern utföhren wullt. Disse Optschoon stellt seker, dat de Sekerheitkopie op den Stand vun Dien leste Ännern op den Reekner is.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, fRunConduitsWithBackup)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_backup.ui:201
msgid "Run conduits durin&g a backup sync"
msgstr "&Kanaals bi't Sekerheitkoperen utföhren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, TextLabel1)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, fPilotDevice)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:18 kpilot/config_page_device.ui:34
msgid "<qt>Enter the device the Pilot is attached to (for instance a serial or USB port) here. You can also use <i>/dev/pilot</i>, and make that a symlink to the correct device. You need write permission to successfully synchronize with the handheld.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Giff hier de Reedschap an, na de de Handreekner tokoppelt is (a.B. en seriell oder USB-Koppelsteed). Du kannst ok <i>/dev/pilot</i> bruken un en Symlink na de richtige Reedschap mit dissen Naam opstellen. Du muttst Schriefverlöven hebben, wenn dat Synkroniseren mit den Handreekner funkscheneren schall.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel1)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:21
msgid "Pilot &device:"
msgstr "Pilot-&Reedschap:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, TextLabel4)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, fPilotSpeed)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:44 kpilot/config_page_device.ui:143
msgid "<qt>Select the speed of the serial connection to your handheld here. This has no meaning for USB devices. For an older model, choose 9600. Newer models may be able to handle speeds up to the maximum listed, 115200. You can experiment with the connection speed: the manual suggests starting at a speed of 19200 and trying faster speeds to see if they work.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Hier kannst Du angeven, wo gau de Verbinnen na Dien Handreekner is. Bi USB-Reedschappen deit disse Optschoon nix. Bruuk 9600 Bd för öller Reedschappen, niegere köönt villicht ok mit de hööchste Gauigkeit (115.200 Bd) kloorkamen. Wenn Du dat utproberen wullt: Dat Handbook raadt an, Du fangst mit en Gauigkeit vun 19.200 Bd an un probeerst denn högere Weerten ut.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel4)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:47
msgid "&Speed:"
msgstr "&Gauigkeit:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel1_2)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, fWorkaround)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:60 kpilot/config_page_device.ui:181
msgid "<qt>Workarounds enable special handling for specific devices. Most devices do not need special handling. However, the Zire 31, Zire 72 and Tungsten T5 <i>do</i> have special needs, so if you are connecting such a device, please select the workaround for them.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Sünner-Bedriefoorden warrt för enkelte Reedschappen bruukt. De mehrsten Reedschappen bruukt keen Sünnerbedrief, man de Zire 31, Zire 72 un Tungsten T5 <i>bruukt</i> en Sünnerbehanneln. Koppelst Du also so en Reedschap to, söök bitte ehr Sünner-Bedriefoort ut.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1_2)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:63
msgid "&Workarounds:"
msgstr "Sünner-&Bedriefoorden:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, fPilotEncoding)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:76 kpilot/config_page_device.ui:204
msgid "<qt>PalmOS devices are available in many different languages. If your device uses a different encoding than ISO-latin1 (ISO8859-1), select the correct encoding here, in order to display special characters correctly.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>PalmOS-Reedschappen gifft dat för vele Spraken. Wenn Dien Reedschap en anner Koderen as ISO-8859-1 (ISO-Latin1) bruukt, söök hier de richtige Koderen ut, wenn Du Sünnertekens richtig wiest kriegen wullt.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:79
msgid "En&coding:"
msgstr "&Koderen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, TextLabel2)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, fUserName)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:92 kpilot/config_page_device.ui:214
msgid "<qt>Enter your name here, as it appears in the Pilot's \"Owner\" setting.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Giff hier Dien Naam in, as he op den Handreekner as Eegner angeven is</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel2)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:95
msgid "Pilot &user:"
msgstr "Pilot-&Bruker:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, fDeviceAutodetect)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:111
msgid "<qt>Click here to try to automatically detect your device, username and connection speed. KPilot will scan for attached devices.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Klick hier, wenn KPilot Dien Reedschap, Brukernaam un Verbinnen-Gauigkeit automaatsch rutfinnen schall. KPilot söcht denn na tokoppelt Reedschappen.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, fDeviceAutodetect)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_device.ui:114
msgid "Autodetect"
msgstr "Automaatsch opdecken"

