#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, fScreenlockSecure)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:92
msgid "<qt>Check this box to prevent KPilot from syncing your handheld while the screensaver is active: this is a security measure to prevent others from syncing <i>their</i> handhelds with your data.  This option must be disabled when you use a different desktop, since KPilot is not aware of screensavers other than KDE's.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Maak dit an, wenn KPilot Dien Handreekner nich synkroniseren schall, bides de Pausschirm löppt. Dit is en Sekerheitfunkschoon, de verhöden deit, dat anner Lüüd <i>ehr</i> Daten mit Dien synkroniseert. Wenn Du nich KDE as Schriefdisch bruukst, muttst Du disse Optschoon utmaken, KPilot kennt bloots de KDE-Pausschirmen.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, fScreenlockSecure)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:95
msgid "Do not sync when screensaver is active"
msgstr "Bi lopen Pausschirm nich synkroniseren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, fFullSyncCheck)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:111
msgid "<qt>Check this box to perform a full sync when your last sync was performed with another PC or system, to guarantee the completeness of your data.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Maak dit an, wenn Du en Heel Synkroniseren utföhren wullt, na dat de verleden Synkroniseren mit en anner Reekner oder Systeem utföhrt wöör. Dit besekert, Dien Daten sünd all dor.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, fFullSyncCheck)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:114
msgid "Do full sync when chan&ging PCs"
msgstr "Na Reekner-&Wesseln heel synkroniseren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, fConflictResolution)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:164
msgid "<qt>Select in this list how conflicting entries (entries which were edited both on your handheld and on the PC) are resolved. Possibly values are  \"Ask User\" to let you decide case by case, \"Do Nothing\" to allow the entries to be different, \"PC overrides\", \"Handheld overrides\", \"Use values from last sync\" and \"Use both entries\" to create a new entry on both the PC and handheld. Note that the conflict resolution option selected here can be overridden by conduits that have their own conflict resolution configuration.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wodennig Konflikten (Indrääg, de op den Reekner un ok op den Handreekner ännert wöörn) oplööst warrt: \"Bruker fragen\" - Du warrst jümmer fraagt, \"Nix doon\" - de Indrääg blifft verscheden, \"Reekner-Indrag bruken\", \"Handreekner-Indrag bruken\", \"Weerten ut verleden Synkroniseren bruken\" un \"Beed Indrääg bruken\" - stellt op den Reekner un ok op den Handreekner en niegen Indrag op. Beacht, Kanaals mit egen Oplöös-Instellen köönt disse Optschoon övergahn.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, fConflictResolution)
#. +> trunk
#: kpilot/config_page_sync.ui:178
msgid "Handheld Overrides"
msgstr "Handreekner-Indrag bruken"

